<div class="bg-grid"></div>

<main class="backup-page">
  <header class="backup-header">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS · RECOVERY</div>
      <h1><i class="fas fa-shield-halved" aria-hidden="true"></i> Backup control room</h1>
      <p class="lede">See whether MongoDB, Qdrant, and supported product configuration are protected in persistent recovery storage before browsing individual artifacts.</p>
    </div>
    <button id="backupRefreshAllBtn" class="btn backup-refresh-all" type="button">
      <i class="fas fa-sync-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i> Refresh all
    </button>
  </header>

  <div id="toast" class="backup-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

  <section id="backupControlRoom" class="backup-control-room is-loading" aria-labelledby="backupOverallTitle">
    <div class="backup-overall">
      <div id="backupOverallIcon" class="backup-overall-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-circle-notch fa-spin"></i></div>
      <div>
        <div id="backupOverallKicker" class="backup-kicker">CHECKING RECOVERY STATE</div>
        <h2 id="backupOverallTitle">Reading the latest backup cycle…</h2>
        <p id="backupOverallSummary">Scheduler evidence is loading.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="backupIncidentPanel" class="backup-incident" role="alert" hidden>
      <div class="backup-incident-heading"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation" aria-hidden="true"></i> Operator attention</div>
      <div id="backupIncidentSummary"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="backup-signal-grid">
      <article class="backup-signal">
        <span>Last cycle</span>
        <strong id="cfgLastCycle">—</strong>
        <small id="cfgLastCycleAt">Waiting for evidence</small>
      </article>
      <article class="backup-signal">
        <span>Layer health</span>
        <strong id="cfgLayerCoverage">—</strong>
        <small>Mongo · Config · Qdrant</small>
      </article>
      <article class="backup-signal">
        <span>Next run</span>
        <strong id="cfgNextRun">—</strong>
        <small id="cfgNextRunReason">Waiting for schedule</small>
      </article>
      <article class="backup-signal">
        <span>Retention</span>
        <strong id="cfgRetentionOverview">—</strong>
        <small id="cfgRetryBudget">Retry budget —</small>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <details class="backup-section backup-settings">
    <summary>
      <span><i class="fas fa-gear" aria-hidden="true"></i> Policy &amp; settings</span>
      <small>Cadence, retention, storage lifecycle, and restore boundary</small>
    </summary>
    <div class="backup-settings-body">
      <div class="backup-settings-grid">
        <label>Recovery storage</label>
        <span id="cfgStorage">—</span>
        <small id="cfgStorageLifecycle">—</small>

        <label>Host-loss protection</label>
        <span id="cfgStorageExport">—</span>
        <small>not implied by local persistence</small>

        <label for="cfgRetentionDays">Retention (days, 0 = forever)</label>
        <div class="backup-inline-control">
          <input id="cfgRetentionDays" type="number" min="0" step="1">
          <button id="cfgSaveBtn" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">Save</button>
        </div>
        <small id="cfgRetentionSrc">—</small>

        <label>Config backup scope</label>
        <span id="cfgConfigScope">—</span>
        <small>Runtime env files, credentials, private adapters, data, and crontab are never captured.</small>

        <label>Restore policy</label>
        <span id="cfgRestorePolicy" class="backup-warning-text">—</span>
        <small>no coherent recovery-set proof yet</small>
      </div>

      <div id="cfgPolicyPanel" class="backup-policy-panel" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <strong>Creation cadence</strong><span id="cfgScheduleStatus">Loading effective scheduler policy…</span>
        <strong>Failure retry</strong><span id="cfgScheduleDetail">—</span>
        <strong>Retention enforcement</strong><span id="cfgRetentionPolicy">—</span>
        <strong>Growth risk</strong><span id="cfgGrowthRisk">—</span>
        <div id="cfgPolicyWarnings" class="backup-policy-warnings"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="backup-note">
        <i class="fas fa-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span><strong>Retention</strong> is runtime-editable and pruning runs after each successful backup operation; changing it does not delete anything immediately. Ordinary <code>down</code> preserves recovery storage. Only the exact confirmed <code>reset</code> removes it.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <div class="backup-layer-stack">
    <section class="backup-section backup-layer" data-backup-layer="mongo" aria-labelledby="mongoTitle">
      <div class="backup-layer-header">
        <div class="backup-layer-identity">
          <span class="backup-layer-icon mongo"><i class="fas fa-leaf" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          <div>
            <div class="backup-kicker">DATABASE</div>
            <h2 id="mongoTitle">MongoDB</h2>
            <p id="mongoEvidence">Loading inventory basis…</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="backup-layer-actions">
          <span id="mongoStatus" class="backup-count">—</span>
          <button id="mongoBackupBtn" class="btn btn-primary" type="button"><i class="fas fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i> Create backup</button>
          <button id="mongoRefreshBtn" class="btn backup-icon-button" type="button" title="Refresh MongoDB inventory" aria-label="Refresh MongoDB inventory"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <details class="backup-inventory">
        <summary>Browse MongoDB recovery artifacts <span>full inventory</span></summary>
        <div class="backup-table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Date</th><th class="align-right">Size</th><th class="align-right">Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="mongoBackupsList"><tr><td colspan="4" class="backup-empty">Loading…</td></tr></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div id="mongoPager" class="backup-pager" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="backup-section backup-layer" data-backup-layer="qdrant" aria-labelledby="qdrantTitle">
      <div class="backup-layer-header">
        <div class="backup-layer-identity">
          <span class="backup-layer-icon qdrant"><i class="fas fa-cube" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          <div>
            <div class="backup-kicker">VECTOR MEMORY</div>
            <h2 id="qdrantTitle">Qdrant</h2>
            <p id="qdrantEvidence">Loading inventory basis…</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="backup-layer-actions">
          <span id="qdrantStatus" class="backup-count">—</span>
          <button id="qdrantBackupBtn" class="btn btn-primary" type="button"><i class="fas fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i> Create snapshot</button>
          <button id="qdrantRefreshBtn" class="btn backup-icon-button" type="button" title="Refresh Qdrant inventory" aria-label="Refresh Qdrant inventory"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <details class="backup-inventory">
        <summary>Browse Qdrant snapshots <span>full inventory</span></summary>
        <div class="backup-table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Created</th><th class="align-right">Size</th><th class="align-right">Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="qdrantBackupsList"><tr><td colspan="4" class="backup-empty">Loading…</td></tr></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div id="qdrantPager" class="backup-pager" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="backup-section backup-layer" data-backup-layer="config" aria-labelledby="configTitle">
      <div class="backup-layer-header">
        <div class="backup-layer-identity">
          <span class="backup-layer-icon config"><i class="fas fa-sliders" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
          <div>
            <div class="backup-kicker">PRODUCT CONFIG</div>
            <h2 id="configTitle">Configuration</h2>
            <p id="configEvidence">Loading inventory basis…</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="backup-layer-actions">
          <span id="configStatus" class="backup-count">—</span>
          <button id="configBackupBtn" class="btn btn-primary" type="button"><i class="fas fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i> Create backup</button>
          <button id="configRefreshBtn" class="btn backup-icon-button" type="button" title="Refresh configuration inventory" aria-label="Refresh configuration inventory"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <details class="backup-inventory">
        <summary>Browse configuration artifacts <span>full inventory</span></summary>
        <div class="backup-table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Date</th><th class="align-right">Size</th><th class="align-right">Actions</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="configBackupsList"><tr><td colspan="4" class="backup-empty">Loading…</td></tr></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div id="configPager" class="backup-pager" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </details>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer class="backup-footer">
    <i class="fas fa-circle-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span>These artifacts are recovery inputs, not proof of a coherent or restorable recovery set. MongoDB and Qdrant restore remain unavailable in the running product until a controlled offline release rehearsal is explicitly enabled; exact typed confirmation remains required after that gate.</span>
  </footer>
</main>

<dialog id="backupConfirmDialog" class="backup-dialog" aria-labelledby="backupConfirmTitle" aria-describedby="backupConfirmDescription">
  <form id="backupConfirmForm">
    <div class="backup-dialog-icon"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
    <h2 id="backupConfirmTitle"></h2>
    <p id="backupConfirmDescription"></p>
    <label for="backupConfirmInput">Type <code id="backupConfirmExpected"></code> exactly</label>
    <input id="backupConfirmInput" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-describedby="backupConfirmError">
    <div id="backupConfirmError" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="backup-dialog-actions">
      <button id="backupConfirmCancel" class="btn" type="button">Cancel</button>
      <button id="backupConfirmSubmit" class="btn backup-danger" type="submit" disabled>Confirm permanent deletion</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>
